=== EXPLAIN (VERBOSE) — accept, no extra detail (divergence) ===
EXPLAIN (VERBOSE) SELECT * FROM ep;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'VERBOSE) SELECT * FROM ep' at line 1
=== KNOWN GAP: EXPLAIN EXTENDED — errno 1064 ===
EXPLAIN EXTENDED SELECT * FROM ep;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'SELECT * FROM ep' at line 1
=== KNOWN GAP: EXPLAIN PARTITIONS — errno 1064 ===
EXPLAIN PARTITIONS SELECT * FROM ep;
ERROR 1064: You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near 'SELECT * FROM ep' at line 1
=== Cleanup ===
DROP TABLE ep;
DROP TABLE j2;
